# openOODA — org profile
File: .github/profile/README.oot

GitHub renders `profile/README.md` at github.com/openOODA.
The public home board is `docs/HOME.oot`. The live site is
https://openooda.org.

A capability-secure systems language.
Every effect needs an unforgeable cap token.

```
curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install.sh | bash
```

